-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line086-pei02-01","text":"吳錄曰：衛旌字子旗，官至尚書。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line086-pei02-01:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"衛旌","kind":"person","person_id":"rns_m67_hfv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line086-pei02-01:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"子旗","kind":"person","person_id":"rns_m67_hfv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":86,"last_line":86,"revision_id":2085149,"raw_start":11448,"raw_end":11463,"character_positions":[11448,11449,11450,11451,11452,11453,11454,11455,11456,11457,11458,11459,11460,11461,11462]},"attribution":{"annotator":"裴松之","attribution_kind":"quoted_work","source_label":"吳錄","attribution_marker":"吳錄曰","reading":"裴注明列所引文獻。","quoted_work":"吳錄"},"attachment":{"received_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line086","received_codepoint":217,"note_ordinal":2,"source_ordinal":1},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092","text":"權稱尊號，拜驃騎將軍，領冀州牧。是歳，都督西陵。代陸遜撫二境，頃以冀州在蜀分，解牧職。時權太子登駐武昌，愛人好善，與騭書曰：「夫賢人君子，所以興隆大化，佐理時務者也。受性暗蔽，不達道數，雖實區區欲盡心於明德，歸分於君子，至於遠近士人，先後之宜，猶或緬焉，未之能詳。《傳》曰：『愛之能勿勞乎？忠焉能勿誨乎？』斯其義也，豈非所望於君子哉！」騭於是條於時事業在荊州界者，諸葛瑾、陸遜、朱然、程普、潘浚，斐玄、夏侯承，衞旌，李肅、周條、石干十一人。甄別行狀，因上疏獎勸曰：","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line092:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"陸遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional",